text The hero component allows you to add a full width banner to your webpage, which can optionally cover the full height of the page as well.
text The basic requirement of this component are:
text hero danger
text hero-body as a direct child, in which you can put all your content
row
  link "fullheight hero" #fullheight-hero
  text hero-head danger
  text hero-foot danger
text Example
text Hero title
text Hero subtitle
text HTML
text "<section class=\"hero\"> <div class=\"hero-body\"> <p class=\"title\">Hero title</p> <p class=\"subtitle\">Hero subtitle</p> </div> </section>"
button Copy danger
h3 "Colors #"
text As with buttons, you can choose one of the 8 different colors:
