h3 "Sizes #"
text You can have even more imposing banners by using one of 5 different sizes:
text is-small
text is-medium
text is-large
text is-halfheight
text is-fullheight
text Example
text Small hero
text Small subtitle
text HTML
text "<section class=\"hero is-small is-primary\"> <div class=\"hero-body\"> <p class=\"title\">Small hero</p> <p class=\"subtitle\">Small subtitle</p> </div> </section>"
button Copy danger
text Example
text Medium hero
text Medium subtitle
text HTML
text "<section class=\"hero is-medium is-link\"> <div class=\"hero-body\"> <p class=\"title\">Medium hero</p> <p class=\"subtitle\">Medium subtitle</p> </div> </section>"
button Copy danger
text Example
text Large hero
text Large subtitle
text HTML
